{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026P0FxKa8rvr1794608103.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台在凌晨時份，一度發出黃色暴雨警告信號。</p><p></p><p>天文台在凌晨3時50分，發出黃色暴雨警告信號，到了清晨5時30分取消。</p><p></p><p>天文台指，與高空擾動相關的驟雨及雷暴，正逐漸遠離珠江口一帶。本港今早普遍錄得超過30毫米雨量，而東部地區及大嶼山雨量更超過50毫米。</p><p></p><p>天文台預測今日大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁，高地間中吹強風。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.506507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:18.958426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:18.958426+00:00","content_hash":"d77ed8247bba9705068e5ea2666f454e0abdf4a89960a3c39cd38a249d985fb9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}